OL,3,GNEWSADevastating fire caused by
OL,4,Adisposable barbecue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which destroyed a number of
OL,7,Fhouses and gardens in Stoke-on-Trent
OL,8,Fwas caused by a disposable barbecue,
OL,9,Finvestigators have confirmed.
OL,11,FFour properties were lost in the blaze
OL,12,Fas dozens of people were evacuated from
OL,13,Ftheir homes when it broke out shortly
OL,14,Fafter 16:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,16,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fsaid it started at the back of Wignall
OL,18,FRoad before reaching residences along
OL,19,FSandy Road and Maureen Avenue.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
