OL,3,GNEWSADevastating fire caused by
OL,4,Adisposable barbecue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said the fire was caused
OL,7,Faccidentally when a disposable barbecue
OL,8,Fignited in Sandyford Park and flames
OL,9,Fspread rapidly due to the wind speed
OL,10,Fand "extremely dry vegetation".
